  "summary": "作者强调巨门亥命太阳对照并不保证天同事业有利，须看吉煞与制煞。盘四丁年空未命擎羊守命，对宫日月同守，三奇成格使事业天同负性受制。古说日月同临保留名称不任意映射；后接未完举例和混排不据以补事实。",
  "summary_en": "Ju Men in Hai Life opposed by Tai Yang does not by itself make Tian Tong in Career favorable; the author requires considering benefics, malefics and their control. In Chart Four, a Ding birth has an otherwise empty Wei Life Palace guarded by Qing Yang, with Sun and Moon together opposite. San Qi Jia Hui is said to strengthen Life and redirect adverse Tian Tong effects in Career. The source’s Ri Yue Tong Lin label is retained without mapping it to a different configuration; the unfinished example and mixed chart are excluded.",
